00:45:07.961 --> 00:45:11.660
so it was like a lot of
relatively low frequency names

00:45:11.661 --> 00:45:14.440
and we only got this from having

00:45:14.441 --> 00:45:17.395
840 billion tokens of which
2.2 million were unique.

00:45:17.396 --> 00:45:18.980
So, we got that from Stanford,

00:45:18.981 --> 00:45:20.420
but we also did the same thing

00:45:20.421 --> 00:45:22.290
