00:47:18.191 --> 00:47:19.900
so we can actually go out
and find out people all

00:47:19.901 --> 00:47:21.700
over the world. What
were they doing?

00:47:21.701 --> 00:47:22.680
Which ones most like you and

00:47:22.681 --> 00:47:23.730
what are you're probably feeling

00:47:23.731 --> 00:47:24.510
if you're doing that if

00:47:24.511 --> 00:47:26.870
the other person tell
us how they felt?

00:47:29.580 --> 00:47:32.790
So, what about phenomenological
consciousness?

00:47:32.791 --> 00:47:34.620
What if we build

00:47:34.621 --> 00:47:36.470
something that's so
amazingly smart that it

00:47:36.471 --> 00:47:38.450
