the same visual experience as

00:47:49.611 --> 00:47:52.090
much as cows do and we eat cows.

00:47:52.091 --> 00:47:55.250
This is a lucky cow
that's out in the field.

00:47:56.120 --> 00:47:58.500
So, we're obliged to build AI.

00:47:58.501 --> 00:47:59.610
We aren't obliged to and that

00:47:59.611 --> 00:48:01.040
was the thing that I
first started writing

00:48:01.041 --> 00:48:02.300
about in the papers
people actually

00:48:02.301 --> 00:48:05.000
