00:48:06.110 --> 00:48:09.810
So, I think what actually
matters is the AI is already

00:48:09.811 --> 00:48:11.340
superhuman and I'm sorry I spent

00:48:11.341 --> 00:48:13.095
so long on the stuff I
didn't think mattered.

00:48:13.096 --> 00:48:15.400
But, that is the stuff I
usually ask questions about.

00:48:15.401 --> 00:48:17.390
So, I think it really

00:48:17.391 --> 00:48:19.775
